# .trivyignore
#
# CVEs accepted for the published crowdsec-toolbox images, consumed by the
# Trivy scans in .github/workflows/release.yml, ci.yml and docs-build.yml.
# The image and docs scans already pass ignore-unfixed, so every entry here is
# a finding that HAS a fix available and is accepted anyway. Each entry needs a
# reason and an `exp:` date, after which Trivy reports it again and forces a
# re-check.
#
# Format: `<id> exp:YYYY-MM-DD`, with the reason in a comment above it.
#
# No entries at the moment. The file stays because the workflows reference it.
